  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-hechangyu-grandfather:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-043-hechangyu-grandfather:p001:m0000" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2_DAAA">何昌宇</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-hechangyu-grandfather:p001:m0004" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2_DAAA">儼望</persName>，廬江灊人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-hechangyu-grandfather:p001:m0014" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2_DA">叔度</persName>，吳郡太守。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-hechangyu-grandfather:p001:m0023" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2_DAA">佟之</persName>，太常。</p>
